{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "周末作业与电影约定的两种沟通方式", "content": "案例：周末，家长答应晚上和孩子一起看电影，前提是孩子回家先做完作业。家长回家发现孩子一到家就在玩电脑，没有做作业的意思。家长想提醒孩子，如果作业没做完，就不会去看电影。两种说法：第一种：“现在马上去做作业，作业没有做完，我是绝对不会带你去看电影的。”第二种：“如果现在你去做作业，那么你应该会有足够的时间在电影开始之前把它做完，这样我们就可以一起去看电影了。否则你可能会来不及做完作业，导致我们必须要取消今天晚上的电影计划。”两种方式可能都让孩子赶紧去做作业，但给孩子带来的感受截然不同。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["沟通方式", "作业", "电影", "界限"], "evidence": "hypothetical", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00008", "b00010"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00008", "b00010"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a004", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "两种沟通方式都设立界限且结果可能相同，但感受不同", "reason": "a003提供具体案例，a004总结该案例说明沟通方式影响感受", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "不同沟通方式带来不同感受", "content": "两种不同的沟通方式可能都让孩子赶紧去做作业，但给孩子带来的感受截然不同。虽然两种方式都设立了界限，结果也可能一样，但注重“怎么说”很重要。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["沟通方式", "感受"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00010"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00010"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a005", "kind": "supports", "condition": "说话方式影响孩子感觉和学习的具体机制支持注重“怎么说”的重要性。", "reason": "说话方式影响孩子对自我和他人的感觉并导致模仿，这进一步说明了不同沟通方式带来不同感受、注重“怎么说”很重要的主张。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向已修正为说话方式影响支持沟通方式重要；原方向反了。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "说话方式影响孩子对自我和他人的感觉", "content": "“怎么说”会直接决定孩子对我们和对他们自己的感觉，并且孩子会从我们说话的方式来学习怎样和别人说话；此外，怎么说还会决定孩子当下对我们的反应。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我认知"], "tags": ["说话方式", "自我感觉", "模仿"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00012"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00012"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a006", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "案例体现了孩子从父母说话方式学习。", "reason": "孩子说话冲与父母说话方式一致的案例是说话方式影响孩子对自我和他人的感觉并导致模仿这一原则的具体实例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向已修正为案例指向原则；原方向反了。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "孩子说话冲与父母说话方式的关联", "content": "案例：讲师去客人家做家庭访问辅导，父母不明白为什么孩子说话那么冲，但讲师发现孩子说话的方式完完全全是父母说话的方式。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我认知"], "tags": ["说话方式", "模仿", "家庭访问"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00012"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00012"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "连接与愉快态度促进孩子配合", "content": "当孩子感到和我们连接并亲密的时候，或者当我们以一种愉快的和有趣的态度和他们沟通时，他们更加容易配合我们的要求。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["连接", "愉快态度", "配合"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00012"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00012"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a008", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "案例体现了愉快、有趣、尊重的态度促进配合。", "reason": "美国高中学生项目中的沟通效果案例是连接与愉快态度促进孩子配合原则的具体实例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向已修正为案例指向原则；原方向反了。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "美国高中学生项目中的沟通效果", "content": "案例：讲师参与一个帮助在美国读高中的学生实现更高计划、考入更好大学、成为更有能力、更具竞争力的学生的项目。这些孩子来自非常富裕的家庭，很有个性，不太愿意听别人的劝告。但在项目中，他们一反常态，非常配合地完成老师设计的极具挑战性甚至非常艰难的项目活动。原因是讲师在“怎么说”这个问题上处理得非常小心，沟通方式是尊重的、有趣的和平和的，引导常常有效得多。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["沟通方式", "尊重", "有趣", "平和", "高中生"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00014"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00014"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u008"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "男孩吃手行为复现的案例", "content": "案例：听众提问，老大男孩从小吃手，两岁半左右突然不吃了，上了幼儿园全天班后又开始吃，但这次只在家里吃，怎么戒也戒不掉。讲师分析：首先要排除孩子在幼儿园被老师或同学虐待或霸凌的情况。一般而言，已经戒掉的行为突然重新回来，是安全感遗失的表征。排除后，很可能是因为开始全天幼儿园课程，不太适应，安全感暂时被破坏。回到家后，他觉得安全感回来了，而在他的记忆里，吃手跟安全感是联系在一起的，所以又恢复了吃手行为。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["吃手", "安全感", "幼儿园", "行为复现"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": ["需核验：行为复现与安全感关联为讲师观点，非诊断标准"], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00016"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00016"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a010", "kind": "supports", "condition": "排除虐待霸凌后，行为复现与安全感遗失相关", "reason": "a009案例中讲师分析行为复现是安全感遗失表征，a010为一般性陈述", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u009"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "行为复现与安全感遗失的关联", "content": "已经戒掉的行为突然重新回来，是安全感遗失的表征。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["行为复现", "安全感"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["需核验：该表征为讲师观点，非普遍诊断标准"], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00016"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00016"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a011", "kind": "causes", "condition": "行为复现源于安全感遗失", "reason": "a010指出行为复现是安全感遗失表征，a011建议不责备不强行改变以免强化不安全感", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u010"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "应对吃手复现的建议：不责备不强行改变", "content": "在孩子吃手的时候，千万不要责备他，也不要试着改变他吃手，因为这样做会让他更加觉得没有安全感，反而强化了吃手的行为，变得越来越难纠正。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["吃手", "责备", "强化"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00018"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00018"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a012", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "应对吃手复现", "reason": "a011建议不责备不强行改变，a012进一步提出改变孩子对幼儿园心理状态的具体方法", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u011"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "改变孩子对幼儿园的心理状态", "content": "要改变孩子对幼儿园的心理状态，让他感觉幼儿园是一个安全的地方。可以对他说类似的话：“妈妈是不是每天下班以后就一定会来接我的宝贝回家呀？”或者“上一次你在幼儿园感觉不舒服的时候，妈妈是不是很快就来接你了呀？”", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["幼儿园", "安全感", "沟通"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00018"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00018"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a013", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "改变孩子对幼儿园心理状态", "reason": "a012提供具体问话示例，a013说明这些问话引导孩子理解幼儿园并非抛弃，从而适应并消除吃手", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u012"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "引导孩子理解幼儿园并非抛弃", "content": "类似的问题会引导孩子明白，他去幼儿园并不是被爸爸妈妈所抛弃了，过一段时间他就又可以回到爸爸妈妈的身边。随着他越来越适应幼儿园全天的生活，吃手的行为慢慢就会消失。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["幼儿园", "安全感", "适应"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-d54b290fb6df-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00020"], "source_kind": "B"}, {"source_id": "s-d54b290fb6df", "blocks": ["b00020"], "source_kind": "B"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-d54b290fb6df-c001:u013"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
